{
  "app_id": 4066520,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "TRUST YOUR GUT is a multi-ball roulette rogue-lite. Stack mementos and balls, place your bets, spin the wheel, and survive one more day. Inspired by Clover Pit, Balatro, and Buckshot Roulette, combine Mementos with unique Ball abilities to create powerful synergies and builds. Pay off your debt, make it to the end of the show, and when you've finally earned your freedom, can you stop? Features: Multi-ball roulette with powerful synergies and builds. 100+ Mementos and 50+ Ball variants. Offers that change the rules. Countless ways to manipulate the odds. 4 playable characters with different playstyles. Showdowns that throw your run into chaos. Campaign and Endless modes. Leaderboards to push your score higher. For those who believe bad luck ruined their lives, the show offers a second chance. Step into a deadly game of roulette, pay off your debt, and earn the life you think you were denied. Everyone has someone to blame. Not here."
  },
